    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new game in the hit 3D puzzle game &quot;Fruit Mountain&quot; where you combine fruits to make them bigger is finally here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, it's fruit battles!? There are plenty of versus modes that everyone can enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get together for online or local multiplayer and have a blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep stacking those fruits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Heated Online Battle Mode!]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with friends and players from around the world in a battle mode for up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic battles with items and surprises!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for exciting matches with a variety of rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Single-player Mode supports Rankings!]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The single-player mode is still available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your skills by battling against NPCs and get ready for online matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Easy to Play!]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply throw fruits and stack them on the plate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine fruits of the same kind to make them bigger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bigger the fruit you make, the higher your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to let any fruits fall off the plate\u2014stack them skillfully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your stacking skills and compete with your rivals!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new game in the hit 3D puzzle game &quot;Fruit Mountain&quot; where you combine fruits to make them bigger is finally here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, it's fruit battles!? There are plenty of versus modes that everyone can enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get together for online or local multiplayer and have a blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep stacking those fruits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Heated Online Battle Mode!]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with friends and players from around the world in a battle mode for up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic battles with items and surprises!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for exciting matches with a variety of rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Single-player Mode supports Rankings!]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The single-player mode is still available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your skills by battling against NPCs and get ready for online matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Easy to Play!]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply throw fruits and stack them on the plate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine fruits of the same kind to make them bigger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bigger the fruit you make, the higher your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to let any fruits fall off the plate\u2014stack them skillfully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your stacking skills and compete with your rivals!</p>",
    "short_description": "A brand new game in the hit 3D puzzle game &quot;Fruit Mountain&quot; where you combine fruits to make them bigger is finally here! This time, it's fruit battles!? There are plenty of versus modes that everyone can enjoy! Get together for online or local multiplayer! Keep stacking those fruits!",
